  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate occult; <strong>BL</strong> 6th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> chest; <strong>Price</strong> 30,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 10 pounds<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nOutwardly plain, this leather vest is stitched with several dozen seals and occult motifs on the inside. While wearing a dedicated vest, the wearer automatically gains the capstone empowerments of any spirits that she is bound to. If a dedicated vest is removed or destroyed while its wearer is bound to a spirit, she becomes stunned for 1d4 rounds and those capstone empowerments are lost.<br>\n<strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, capstone spellcasting; Cost 15,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pm-wondrous-items#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
